[{"name":"Release v0.2.0","uuid":"297624933","tag_name":"v0.2.0","target_commitish":"main","body":"## [0.2.0] - 2026-03-16\r\n\r\n- Added vision-based PPO training configs for `CartpoleBalance` and\r\n  `PandaPickCubeCartesian` with tuned hyperparameters.\r\n- Update vision notebooks to use MuJoCo Warp.\r\n- Default MuJoCo implementation for all envs is now MuJoCo Warp.\r\n- Renamed deprecated `nconmax` / `nccdmax` config fields to `naconmax` /\r\n  `naccdmax` across all environments, matching the updated MJX API.\r\n","draft":false,"prerelease":false,"immutable":null,"published_at":"2026-03-16T18:52:37.000Z","created_at":"2026-04-06T18:14:12.541Z","author":"btaba","assets":[],"last_synced_at":"2026-04-06T18:14:12.086Z","html_url":"https://github.com/google-deepmind/mujoco_playground/releases/tag/v0.2.0","release_url":"https://repos.ecosyste.ms/api/v1/hosts/GitHub/repositories/google-deepmind%2Fmujoco_playground/releases/v0.2.0","tag_url":"https://repos.ecosyste.ms/api/v1/hosts/GitHub/repositories/google-deepmind%2Fmujoco_playground/tags/v0.2.0"}]